<title>USA: U.S. stocks open higher, techs lead rally.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open higher, techs lead rally.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened modestly higher on Tuesday, with technology shares staging the strongest early gains.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials was up five points to 6,469. The Nasdaq Composite was up 10 at 1,326, while the S&amp;P Index rose one to 751.</p>
<p>The 30-year bond was down 12/32 to yield 6.49 percent as Wall Street opened.</p>
